  "description": "A pure C# terminal emulator engine: a VT500 (DEC ANSI / Paul Williams) parser plus a screen and scrollback buffer. No UI and no pseudo-terminal, so it can be driven from anything — a control, a test, a recorded session. Alternate screen, truecolor, Unicode width, scroll regions, OSC 8 hyperlinks, bracketed paste, mouse reporting, synchronized output.",
